  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">EU-Ghana Pact for Skills: Support tertiary education for sustainable employability</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&lt;p class=&quot;ql-align-justify&quot;&gt;The action &lt;strong&gt;EU-Ghana Pact for Skills: Support tertiary education for sustainable employability &lt;/strong&gt;is financed by the EU and implemented by UNCDF in close collaboration with key partners such as &lt;em&gt;E4Impact through its NGO subsidiary in Ghana BOOSTEA.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;ql-align-justify&quot;&gt;The &lt;strong&gt;specific objectives (outputs)&lt;/strong&gt; of the action are:&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;ql-align-justify&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;1&lt;/strong&gt; Strengthened coordination mechanisms for tertiary education institutions with the private sector and increased policy dialogue&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;2&lt;/strong&gt; Increased training packages on digital skills and availability of modern workplace and employability services.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;3&lt;/strong&gt;. Enhanced acceleration and incubation services within Academic Centre of excellence. // Increased training packages and availability of modern workplace for entrepreneurship and green skills.&lt;/p&gt;</narrative>
  </description>
